{"seq":3,"slug":"scaling-control-io-bottleneck","title":"制冷与控制线路的规模化瓶颈","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-frontier-research/quantum-computing-engineering/hardware-qubit-platforms/scaling-control-io-bottleneck","wordCount":3172,"readingTime":13,"html":"<h1 id=\"制冷与控制线路的规模化瓶颈\">制冷与控制线路的规模化瓶颈</h1><p>把超导量子比特从一百个做到一万个，最硬的墙不在芯片上，而在芯片外面那根竖向的、塞满细同轴线的低温柱里。今天的处理器已能造出上千个物理比特，但把每个比特接到室温控制仪器上所需的线，都要穿过稀释制冷机从 300 K 降到 10 mK 的多个温度台阶，每一段都在从冷端偷走本就稀薄的制冷功率。Bluefors 面向大比特数设计的 KIDE 平台，20 mK 台阶三个区段合计只有 90 μW 以上（<a href=\"https://bluefors.com/products/kide/\">https://bluefors.com/products/kide/</a> ）。这意味着能塞进去的控制线数量先于比特数触顶。</p>\n<p>本文拆开&quot;控制 I/O&quot;这条常被低估的链路：制冷机的功率账怎么算、每根同轴线付出多少热代价、控制电子学怎么往低温搬、多路复用怎样把线路数从&quot;一比一&quot;压到&quot;多比一&quot;。读完再看各家&quot;百万比特&quot;路线图时，就能分辨哪些是工程排期、哪些是还没解决的物理预算问题。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><ul>\n<li><strong>稀释制冷机（dilution refrigerator）</strong>：靠 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mrow></mrow><mn>3</mn></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">^3</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">3</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>He/<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mrow></mrow><mn>4</mn></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">^4</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">4</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>He 混合液相分离制冷，最冷点（混合室）在 10–20 mK，是超导比特的宿主。</li>\n<li><strong>制冷功率（cooling power）</strong>：每个温度台阶每秒能带走的热量，20 mK 台阶只有几十 μW，是整条链路的硬预算。</li>\n<li><strong>热漏（heat leak）</strong>：每根穿舱线从暖端传导下来的热，加上焦耳热与辐射热，直接吃掉 mK 段制冷功率。</li>\n<li><strong>低温电子学（cryo-electronics）</strong>：把脉冲发生、数字化、复用逻辑搬到 4 K 或更冷台阶的电路，用低温功耗替换线传导热。</li>\n<li><strong>多路复用（multiplexing）</strong>：多个比特共享一条物理通道，按时分或频分区分，把&quot;每比特一条线&quot;的系数压小。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>一次控制脉冲从室温出发、穿过各温度台阶、再原路返回的完整路径如下——每一段都在消耗制冷功率：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;  RT[&quot;300 K 室温机架&lt;br/&gt;AWG / 数字化仪 / 本振&quot;] --&gt; C1[&quot;同轴线&lt;br/&gt;传导热 + 焦耳热&quot;]&#10;  C1 --&gt; S4[&quot;4 K 板&lt;br/&gt;W 级制冷&quot;]&#10;  S4 --&gt; C2[&quot;衰减器&lt;br/&gt;压噪声至量子限&quot;]&#10;  C2 --&gt; S1[&quot;0.7 K / 100 mK 冷板&lt;br/&gt;mW 至数十 μW&quot;]&#10;  S1 --&gt; MC[&quot;10-20 mK 混合室&lt;br/&gt;比特芯片&quot;]&#10;  MC --&gt; RO[&quot;读出原路返回&lt;br/&gt;环形器 + 行波参量放大器&quot;]&#10;  RO --&gt; RT\">flowchart TD\n  RT[\"300 K 室温机架&lt;br/&gt;AWG / 数字化仪 / 本振\"] --&gt; C1[\"同轴线&lt;br/&gt;传导热 + 焦耳热\"]\n  C1 --&gt; S4[\"4 K 板&lt;br/&gt;W 级制冷\"]\n  S4 --&gt; C2[\"衰减器&lt;br/&gt;压噪声至量子限\"]\n  C2 --&gt; S1[\"0.7 K / 100 mK 冷板&lt;br/&gt;mW 至数十 μW\"]\n  S1 --&gt; MC[\"10-20 mK 混合室&lt;br/&gt;比特芯片\"]\n  MC --&gt; RO[\"读出原路返回&lt;br/&gt;环形器 + 行波参量放大器\"]\n  RO --&gt; RT</pre><h2 id=\"稀释制冷机的功率账本\">稀释制冷机的功率账本</h2><p>稀释制冷机靠 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mrow></mrow><mn>3</mn></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">^3</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">3</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>He/<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mrow></mrow><mn>4</mn></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">^4</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">4</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>He 混合液相分离制冷，混合室（mixing chamber）是整机最冷点。它的制冷功率有明确的温度标度律：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>Q</mi><mo>˙</mo></mover><mi>m</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>84</mn><mtext> </mtext><msub><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>n</mi><mo>˙</mo></mover><mn>3</mn></msub><mtext> </mtext><msup><mi>T</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mtext> (W)</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\dot{Q}_m = 84\\,\\dot{n}_3\\,T^2 \\ \\text{(W)}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.1146em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.9202em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">Q</span></span><span style=\"top:-3.2523em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.0556em;\"><span class=\"mord\">˙</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1944em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">m</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.1141em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">84</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6679em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.1389em;\"><span class=\"mord\">˙</span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">3</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8641em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\"> </span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">(W)</span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>n</mi><mo>˙</mo></mover><mn>3</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\dot{n}_3</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8179em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6679em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.1389em;\"><span class=\"mord\">˙</span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">3</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mrow></mrow><mn>3</mn></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">^3</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">3</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>He 循环摩尔流率，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>T</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span></span></span></span></span> 为混合室温度。这个 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>T</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T^2</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 依赖是理解一切约束的起点：100 mK 处同样流率能带走的功率，到 20 mK 处只剩 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">(</mo><mfrac><mn>20</mn><mn>100</mn></mfrac><mo fence=\"true\">)</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">%</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\left(\\frac{20}{100}\\right)^2 = 4\\%</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.404em;vertical-align:-0.35em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size1\">(</span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8451em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.655em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">100</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.394em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">20</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.345em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mclose delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size1\">)</span></span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.054em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.3029em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8056em;vertical-align:-0.0556em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">4%</span></span></span></span></span>。这不是可优化的余量，是焓差决定的。相分离只在约 870 mK 以下发生，低于约 30 mK 后卡皮查热阻让换热面积急剧膨胀，极低温段必须用细银粉换热器（<a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Dilution_refrigerator\">https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Dilution_refrigerator</a> ）。</p>\n<p>真正的规模灾难在几何上。为了把混合室温度进一步压低，管径按 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msubsup><mi>T</mi><mi>m</mi><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></msubsup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T_m^{-3}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0611em;vertical-align:-0.247em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.453em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">m</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">−</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">3</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.247em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 缩放、长度按 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msubsup><mi>T</mi><mi>m</mi><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>8</mn></mrow></msubsup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T_m^{-8}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0611em;vertical-align:-0.247em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.453em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">m</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">−</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">8</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.247em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 缩放、体积按 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msubsup><mi>T</mi><mi>m</mi><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>14</mn></mrow></msubsup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T_m^{-14}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0611em;vertical-align:-0.247em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.453em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">m</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">−</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">14</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.247em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 缩放。温度从 2 mK 降到 1 mK，管径要涨 8 倍、长度 256 倍、体积 16384 倍——1 cm³ 的冷区会变成 16.4 L。这条定律解释了为什么&quot;把冰箱做得更冷&quot;在 2 mK 附近基本封死，工程师只能接受&quot;每提升一个数量级的比特数，就要换一种线路架构&quot;。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>温度台阶</th>\n<th>典型温度</th>\n<th>主要作用</th>\n<th>可用制冷功率量级</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>板级预冷</td>\n<td>4 K</td>\n<td>辐射屏蔽、截断传导热</td>\n<td>W 级</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>冷板（still）</td>\n<td>~500–700 mK</td>\n<td>截断向下传导热</td>\n<td>mW 级</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>冷板（CP）</td>\n<td>~100 mK</td>\n<td>衰减器热锚点</td>\n<td>数十至数百 μW</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>混合室</td>\n<td>10–20 mK</td>\n<td>比特本体、末级衰减</td>\n<td>数十 μW</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>KIDE 的公开指标正对应这张表的底端：三个独立稀释单元在 20 mK 合计 &gt;90 μW，在 100 mK &gt;3000 μW，基础温度 10 mK，配 1.6 m² 基温法兰和 500 kg 载荷（<a href=\"https://bluefors.com/products/kide/\">https://bluefors.com/products/kide/</a> ）。注意 20 mK 那一栏的数值——它同时要支付所有控制线的末段热漏和比特芯片自身的辐射与准粒子耗散。<strong>制冷功率是这一层唯一真正稀缺的资源，比特数和线数都要向它缴税。</strong></p>\n<h2 id=\"每根同轴线偷走多少制冷功率\">每根同轴线偷走多少制冷功率</h2><p>一根从室温穿到混合室的同轴线，热漏由三部分组成：金属内外导体沿线的<strong>传导热</strong>、介质损耗与直流电阻带来的<strong>焦耳热</strong>、以及外壳的<strong>辐射热</strong>。衰减器通常被热锚到对应冷板以截断上游热流，但截断点以下那一小段仍会把热量漏到混合室。</p>\n<p>这个代价可以定量算。一项微波高密度布线的低温热建模（arXiv:2502.01945 ）测量了 SC-086/50-SCN-CN 半刚性同轴电缆从低温到室温的导热率与直流电阻，并在 Bluefors XLD1000-SL 稀释制冷机上建立静态传导与欧姆加热模型。结论很具体：对 100 至 225 比特规模的处理器，<strong>理论架构上限约 200 比特</strong>；再扣掉制冷功率的工程裕度和读出电路占用的空间，<strong>实际可行上限约 140 比特</strong>（arXiv:2502.01945 ）。</p>\n<p>即使不考虑串扰、校准和纠错复杂度，仅&quot;把线塞进冰箱并付得起热账&quot;这一件事，就把当前一代大型稀释制冷机的超导比特规模圈在百位数。这解释了 2026 年各家旗舰芯片的比特数为何都在一百到两百之间徘徊：IBM 的 Heron r1 为 133 比特、r2/r3 为 156 比特（<a href=\"https://www.ibm.com/quantum/roadmap\">https://www.ibm.com/quantum/roadmap</a> ），Google Willow 为 105 比特（<a href=\"https://blog.google/technology/research/google-willow-quantum-chip/\">https://blog.google/technology/research/google-willow-quantum-chip/</a> ）。跨越这个数量级，必须改变&quot;每根线管一个控制通道&quot;的假设——而分子之所以是&quot;一比特一条以上专用线&quot;，是因为一个 transmon 通常需要一条 XY 驱动线、一条（或共享的）Z 通量偏置线，以及经共用谐振腔耦合、再由环形器接行波参量放大器（TWPA）的读出线。</p>\n<h2 id=\"控制电子学向低温迁移的三条路线\">控制电子学向低温迁移的三条路线</h2><p>把控制电子从室温搬进冰箱，本质是用&quot;低温产生的热&quot;替换&quot;室温线传导进来的热&quot;——前者可按需最小化，后者每根线都在恒定漏热。三条主流路线各有取舍。</p>\n<p><strong>低温 CMOS（cryo-CMOS）</strong> 用标准工艺在 4 K 或更冷台阶产生脉冲，把数字指令就地转成模拟波形，省掉大量室温长线。Intel 的 Horse Ridge 系列是代表：22 nm FinFET Low Power（22FFL）工艺，2019 年 12 月发布，Horse Ridge II 于 2020 年 12 月推出，集成 22 个高速 DAC，可在 4 K 驱动最多 16 个自旋比特（<a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Horse_Ridge_(chip)\">https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Horse_Ridge_(chip)</a> ）。研究层面，一款 3 K 的 CMOS 控制芯片已能相干驱动 20 mK 的硅自旋比特，理想比特假设下电学性能对应 99.99% 保真度（arXiv:2009.14185 ）；更激进的方案把约 10 万个晶体管放到近 100 mK，用浮栅电荷存储避免每个栅极配外部线（arXiv:1912.01299 ）。</p>\n<p><strong>超导单磁通量子（RSFQ/AQFP）逻辑</strong> 靠磁通量量子而非晶体管电流翻转，静态功耗理论上为零，适合放在最冷端。一项方案用绝热量子磁通参量子（AQFP）逻辑在 10 mK 工作，<strong>每比特耗散仅 111 pW</strong>，配合微波与时分复用，只用少数几根室温控制线就完成多比特并行 X 门与虚拟 Z 门，且未观察到相干性退化（arXiv:2603.27231 ）。111 pW 放在功率账本里读：它比一根线漏到 mK 段的热量低几个数量级。</p>\n<p><strong>射频光子学（RF-photonics）</strong> 用光纤替代铜同轴，靠光调制把信号送到低温端解调。光纤导热率远低于金属同轴线，且可用波分复用（WDM）在一根光纤上叠加多个通道；在噪声与热预算约束下，这条路径可望通向约 1000 比特（arXiv:2210.15756 ）。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>路线</th>\n<th>工作温度</th>\n<th>关键指标</th>\n<th>主要代价</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>低温 CMOS</td>\n<td>4 K / 3 K</td>\n<td>22 nm 工艺、单芯片驱 16 比特</td>\n<td>4 K 段功率有限、噪声需隔离</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>CMOS @ mK</td>\n<td>~100 mK</td>\n<td>~10 万晶体管、浮栅搬移</td>\n<td>低温阈值漂移、模型不成熟</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>AQFP / RSFQ</td>\n<td>10 mK</td>\n<td>111 pW/比特、少数室温线</td>\n<td>需超导工艺、生态不通用</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>RF 光子学</td>\n<td>全温区</td>\n<td>波分复用、~1000 比特路径</td>\n<td>光电转换效率、低温探测器</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>一条互补思路是把控制电子留在稍暖台阶，但在它与比特之间插入<strong>热绝缘屏障</strong>：声子分布式布拉格反射器用 Ta/SiO₂ 多层结构充当超导通孔的机械支撑兼热流抑制层，600 nm、10 个双层即可把 1.5 K 到 100 mK 的传导压到 1 mW/cm² 以下（arXiv:2603.13726 ）。</p>\n<h2 id=\"多路复用-把线路数从-n-降到-n-k\">多路复用：把线路数从 N 降到 N/k</h2><p>如果控制电子不能马上搬进冰箱，&quot;减少线的总数&quot;就是另一条主线，手段是多路复用（multiplexing）：不比特专用一条线，而是让多个比特共享一条物理通道，靠时间或频率调度区分。</p>\n<p>一条射频低温 CMOS 复用器工作在 15 mK 以下，为超导比特提供控制通道，同时限制热耦合与电子串扰：静态与动态操作下 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>T</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T_1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 不变、<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>T</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T_2</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 仅轻微受影响，在合适的热滤波下单比特门保真度高于 99.9%，并通过动态时间窗口实现时分复用的比特控制（arXiv:2209.13060 ）。另一款工作在 32 mK 的低温 CMOS 复用器在 10 GHz 内保持可用微波性能，用<strong>一进一出两根线</strong>表征了四个高 Q 超导谐振腔，直接缓解了大规模系统的布线瓶颈（arXiv:2011.11514 ）。还有工作表明，商用现成 CMOS 复用器在亚开尔文温度下可把可用布线数提升约<strong>一个数量级</strong>（arXiv:1907.11816 ）。</p>\n<p>这些数字的意义可以写成一个简单预算。设 mK 段可用制冷功率为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>Q</mi><mn>20</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">Q_{20}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8778em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">Q</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">20</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，每根线漏到该段的热量为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>q</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">q</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">q</span></span></span></span></span>，末级放大器与衰减器占用 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>Q</mi><mrow><mi>o</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>h</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>r</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">Q_{other}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8778em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">Q</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">o</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">h</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">er</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，则可支撑的独立通道数上界为：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>N</mi><mi>max</mi><mo>⁡</mo></msub><mo>≈</mo><mfrac><mrow><msub><mi>Q</mi><mn>20</mn></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>Q</mi><mrow><mi>o</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>h</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>r</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><mi>q</mi></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">N_{\\max} \\approx \\frac{Q_{20} - Q_{other}}{q}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.109em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mop mtight\"><span class=\"mtight\">m</span><span class=\"mtight\">a</span><span class=\"mtight\">x</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.2408em;vertical-align:-0.8804em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3603em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">q</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">Q</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">20</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">Q</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">o</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">h</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">er</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8804em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>多路复用把&quot;每比特需要的通道数&quot;从 1 降到 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>1</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mi>k</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">1/k</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1/</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span></span>，等价于把 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>q</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">q</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">q</span></span></span></span></span> 在分母上除以 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>k</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">k</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span></span>，比特数上界放大约 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>k</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">k</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span></span> 倍。这正是 200 比特的天花板在引入复用后可被推高的原因——瓶颈没有被消除，而是被重新定价了。但复用不是免费的午餐：时分复用要求比特在未被选中的时间窗内保持相干，频分复用要解决相邻通道的串扰与交调，共享通道还意味着一次校准错误会影响整组比特。<strong>它把&quot;线路热账&quot;换成了&quot;调度与控制复杂度账&quot;，后者的上限更软，但并非没有。</strong></p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>稀释制冷机的制冷功率在 20 mK 台阶只有几十 μW 量级，且随 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>T</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T^2</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 下降，是整条链路唯一真正稀缺的资源（Bluefors KIDE：&gt;90 μW @ 20 mK、&gt;3000 μW @ 100 mK <a href=\"https://bluefors.com/products/kide/\">https://bluefors.com/products/kide/</a> ）。</li>\n<li>制冷机几何缩放极其陡峭：温度减半意味着管径 ×8、长度 ×256、体积 ×16384，2 mK 以下基本封死（<a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Dilution_refrigerator\">https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Dilution_refrigerator</a> ）。</li>\n<li>仅考虑同轴线热漏，当前一代大型稀释制冷机的超导比特理论上限约 200 比特、实际约 140 比特（arXiv:2502.01945 ）——这解释了 2026 年旗舰芯片普遍停留在 100–200 比特。</li>\n<li>控制电子向低温迁移有三条路线：低温 CMOS（Horse Ridge 22 nm/4 K，arXiv:2009.14185 ）、超导 AQFP 逻辑（10 mK、111 pW/比特，arXiv:2603.27231 ）、射频光子学（~1000 比特，arXiv:2210.15756 ）。</li>\n<li>多路复用把每比特通道数从 1 降到 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>1</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mi>k</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">1/k</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1/</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span></span>，等效于把比特上界放大约 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>k</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">k</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span></span> 倍；已有低温复用器用两根线表征四个谐振腔（arXiv:2011.11514 ）。</li>\n<li>瓶颈的性质在变化而非消失：从&quot;热预算&quot;转向&quot;串扰、校准与控制复杂度&quot;。判断&quot;百万比特&quot;路线图是否可信，先看它有没有正面回答 mK 段功率账与多路复用比例。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>同章两篇前置文档可作对照：<a href=\"qubit-modality-landscape\">量子比特实现路线与物理模型</a>说明不同路线对控制线的需求为何不同，<a href=\"coherence-fidelity-metrics\">相干时间与门保真度度量体系</a>解释复用串扰如何反映到保真度上。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"制冷与控制线路的规模化瓶颈","id":"制冷与控制线路的规模化瓶颈"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"稀释制冷机的功率账本","id":"稀释制冷机的功率账本"},{"level":2,"text":"每根同轴线偷走多少制冷功率","id":"每根同轴线偷走多少制冷功率"},{"level":2,"text":"控制电子学向低温迁移的三条路线","id":"控制电子学向低温迁移的三条路线"},{"level":2,"text":"多路复用：把线路数从 N 降到 N/k","id":"多路复用-把线路数从-n-降到-n-k"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"相干时间与门保真度度量体系","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-frontier-research/quantum-computing-engineering/hardware-qubit-platforms/coherence-fidelity-metrics"},"next":{"title":"量子比特控制脉冲与标定流程","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-frontier-research/quantum-computing-engineering/control-compilation-stack/control-pulse-calibration"}}